  "body": "<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span>빵<ruby>춘<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>헝<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QjyGy5LdWB4?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>獨夜<rt>덕야ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>伴<rt>퐐ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>守<rt>쥬ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>燈下<rt>뎽ˉ에ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>清風<rt>촁ˉ헝ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>對面<rt>뒤ˋ삔ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>吹<rt>체ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.65em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tork-yā bo-phoā̰ jiû-tiēng-ē, chiēng-hông tùi-bīn chê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>十<rt>잡-</rt></ruby><ruby>七<rt>칟ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>八<rt>뵣</rt></ruby> <ruby>未<rt>뻬-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>出嫁<rt>춛ˆ게</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>見<rt>길ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>少年家<rt>ᄉᆤˋ롄게ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jap-chît-poeh be-chût-ke, kḭ̀-tioh-siàu-lien-kê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>果然<rt>고ˆ뗸-</rt></ruby><ruby>漂緻<rt>ᄇᆤˉ디</rt></ruby> <ruby>面肉<rt>삔빻</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>白<rt>벻ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>誰<rt>쉬-</rt></ruby><ruby>家<rt>게ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>人子弟<rt>랑즈ˆ데ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kô-rien-piāu-ti bin-bah pêh, sui-kê lang-ĵ-tē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想欲<rt>슐뾯ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>問<rt>믕-</rt></ruby><ruby>이<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>驚<rt>걀ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>歹勢<rt>패ˆ세</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>心內<rt>심ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>彈<rt>돨-</rt></ruby><ruby>琵琶<rt>비베ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-boêh-mng-ī kiā̰-phâi-se, sīm-lāi toa̰-pi-pé\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想欲<rt>슐뾯ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>良君<rt>령군ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>做<rt>조ˋ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>翁婿<rt>앙ˉ새</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>意愛<rt>이ˋ애</rt></ruby> <ruby>在<rt>재-</rt></ruby><ruby>心內<rt>심ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-boêh-liong-kûn jò-āng-sai, ì-ai jai-sīm-lāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>待<rt>태-</rt></ruby><ruby>何時<rt>호시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>君<rt>군ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>採<rt>채ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>青春<rt>촁ˉ춘ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>花<rt>훼ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>當開<rt>등ˉ캐ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thai-ho-sí kûn lai-chài, chiēng-chûn huê tn̄g-khâi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.95em\">\n    <ruby>忽<rt>훋ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>聽<rt>턀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>外口<rt>꽈ᄏᅷˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>來<rt>래ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>開門<rt>퀴ˉ믕ˊ</rt></ruby> 가<ruby>이<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>看覓<rt>콸ˋ매ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.61em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hût-thiā̰-goa-khàu u-lang-lái, khūi-mńg ka-ī khoà̰-māi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>月老<rt>꽏로ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>笑<rt>쵸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>慐<rt>껑-</rt></ruby><ruby>大<rt>돠-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>呆<rt>대ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>風<rt>헝ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>騙<rt>폔</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.65em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goat-lò chiò-gùn gong-toa-tâi, hor-hōng-phien m-jâi\n  </span>\n</p>\n",
